diff --git a/changelog.d/1230.change.md b/changelog.d/1230.change.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..2fb53e59
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1230.change.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+On slotted classes with `functools.cached_property`s, an `AttributeError` raised by a property (or any other descriptor) is no longer replaced by a generic `AttributeError` from the `__getattr__` that attrs adds to support cached properties.
